Step 2 – Decide Protection Priorities  
Because we do not have enough drones to protect every field and we “prefer protection of the most threatened fields”, we choose to protect those with a threat level of 0.10 or higher. (Lower‐threat fields – even though some have “needed” counts – will have their drones sent “idle”.) Under this rule the fields selected for protection are:  

• Field_1 (0.16) – already fully protected  
• Field_11 (0.19) – needs 3 drones  
• Field_12 (0.10) – needs 6 drones  
