• Field_63 (center ≈ (130,6)): assign one drone that is “least bad” from the available—here, Drone_34 has been re‐directed to fill this solitary slot.

All drones that were originally “moving_to_field” a nonpriority field (or whose field already received full quota) and the rest of the idle ones now become idle.

Step 5 – Final Group Assignments 
