 • Field_38 (0.06, 3) gets 3.
 • Field_10 (0.06, 6) gets 6.
 • Field_19 (0.06, 3) gets 3.
 • Field_64 (0.06, 2) gets 2.
Any drones not used in these assignments remain in the idle group.

Step 5. The final assignment is then produced as one line per drone (in increasing drone number order) noting for each its final group. (Drones originally “moving‐to–field” that are in surplus to the need for their targeted field are re–assigned to idle.) 

